WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.005
The checklist you’ll use all studio.

2
00:00:02.285 --> 00:00:10.840
For any structured extraction: require evidence and verify it as an exact, whitespace-normalized substring, rejecting empty quotes.

3
00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.491
Encode cross-field rules as named functions with tests.

4
00:00:14.771 --> 00:00:18.739
Give every field the source might not cover a legal null, with a reason.

5
00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:23.477
Don’t gate on self-reported confidence until you’ve measured its calibration.

6
00:00:23.757 --> 00:00:31.971
Use multi-sample agreement and a narrow second-model check where stakes justify the cost, and measure the checker against your own labels.

7
00:00:32.251 --> 00:00:35.920
Route the rest to a person, and audit a sample of what you accept.

8
00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:41.533
The lab this week builds the first two layers end to end, and the project asks for all of them.
